§P root.cause
  ✓ HIR `Enum::Variant` path previously became unresolved `cssl.path_ref`.
  ✓ Cranelift.object materialized unresolved path-ref as typed zero.
  ✓ MIR match discarded pattern identity.
  ✓ object match assumed source-arm-index = declaration discriminant.
  ✓ JIT had no match admission.
  ∴ every constructor appeared tag0 ; reversed source arms dispatched incorrectly.

§D accepted.delta
  1. MirEnumLayout retains exact declaration-order variant names + tag lookup.
  2. csslc root+aux builds collect layouts before body lowering ; duplicate bare
     enum identities become pathless instead of insertion-order selected.
  3. exact `Enum::Variant` constructor emits unsigned scalar discriminant
     width={i8@count≤256,i16@count≤65536,i32@larger} + nominal provenance.
  4. nominal match requires qualified.payload-free.unique.total arms + identical
     MIR yields ; records exact source-arm→declaration-tag vector.
  5. SCF validator requires nonempty enum identity + exact arm/region count
     + total discriminant bijection.
  6. Cranelift object+JIT build declaration-tag→source-arm jump table.
  7. generic function specializations receive same exact nominal layout table ;
     pathless constructors inside specialization preserve typed refusal.
  8. profile arm order reversed intentionally ; ABI9002 status becomes 9002→0.

§D refusal.contract
  ✓ typed MIR op := cssl.nominal_variant.error {code,detail,source_loc}.
  ✓ object/JIT preserve code+detail as NominalVariantFailure.
  codes := {
    ABI9002-PATHLESS-CONSTRUCTOR, ABI9002-PATHLESS-PATTERN,
    ABI9002-PATHLESS-LAYOUT, ABI9002-PAYLOAD-ENUM,
    ABI9002-PAYLOAD-CONSTRUCTOR, ABI9002-PAYLOAD-PATTERN,
    ABI9002-UNSUPPORTED-PATTERN, ABI9002-FOREIGN-PATTERN,
    ABI9002-UNKNOWN-VARIANT, ABI9002-DUPLICATE-PATTERN,
    ABI9002-NONEXHAUSTIVE-MATCH, ABI9002-ARM-TYPE-MISMATCH,
    ABI9002-MALFORMED-DISPATCH, ABI9002-MALFORMED-REGION
  }.
  ✓ legacy.native-x64 remains explicit UnsupportedOp.scf.match + writes no object.
  ✓ JIT generic/non-nominal scf.match remains explicit UnsupportedMirOp.
  ✓ object generic-match historical path remains unchanged.

