§C verdict
  ✓ ABI9002 := BOUNDED_ACCEPT_CANDIDATE.
  ✓ exact claim := implicit declaration-order discriminants + payload-free nominal
    constructors + exhaustive qualified matches on csslc Cranelift object/JIT paths
    + generic-function specialization preservation.
  N! explicit discriminants | payload variants | wildcard/binding patterns |
    partial matches | generic-enum type specialization | invalid external tag behavior
    | raw public C enum ABI promoted.
  N! profile oracle crosses i32 status only ; no enum value crosses C boundary.
  ✗ full.P1a.native.profile := REJECTED ; record9001 remains intentional.
  ○ residual.P1a := native record layout + manifest content-byte binding
    + canonical codec/multiblock SHA256 + RNG admission + normalization
    + nonvacuous executable NIL + non-Cranelift backend parity
    + root independent review + canonical Apocv4 evidence/graph integration.
  N! merge|deployment|release|training|spend|runtime-cutover authority inferred.
  N! Apocv4 canonical six mutated.
  N! graphify-out staged|reverted ; foreign generated state preserved.

strongest.countercase := declaration-backed unit tags prove nominal identity only
  inside admitted compiler paths ; generic-enum type specialization, payload layout,
  explicit source discriminants, invalid external tags, unwind, and cross-language
  enum ABI remain outside proof.
